    "figures": "v003 (2026-08-03): figures_by_section rebuilt from 20 to 102 beats across 9 sections. 20 was far under the animation_density floor (other episodes run 78-91 over 27-30 min; this is 40 min). Every fact is from FACTS_LEDGER.v002 — the two quarantined claims (the 'less than half required strength' fraction, and any stated collapse duration) appear nowhere, and the collapse time is given as 1:22 because that quarantine was released against NIST's own annotated camera frames. Only the 16 FigureBeats kinds whose prop shapes were verified against working configs are used.",
    "hero_windows": "Blender section shots go in via FilmData.heroCuts, not as cuts. Shot 1 (punching shear) is built and measured: remotion/src/blender/surfside_section.py, 6.0 s, no frozen frames, no black frames. Shots 2-6 pending.",
