    "quarantined": "Not used anywhere: a collapse duration, a precise collapse minute, the strength fraction. See the ledger's quarantine rows.",
    "figure_kinds": "Every kind here is registered in remotion/src/components/FigureBeats.tsx. yearsweep is exported by motionkit but is NOT a FigureBeats kind - it was in the first draft of this config and would have failed silently at build time.",
    "revision_note": "v002 (2026-08-02): retargeted from script v003 to v004. v004 restores the collapse time to 1:22 a.m. (quarantine released, CT-32) and adds the two-stage collapse — the pool deck fell more than four minutes before the tower (CT-24) — plus a how-they-know beat. Word count rose 6,154 -> 6,304, still inside the 6,150-6,350 band. The three paths below (asset_manifest, narration_index, captions) do not exist yet; they are produced by the assembly thread.",
    "section_keys": "THE_NIGHT is a section in its own right (34:30-36:45 in script v004) and the narration index must emit it as its own section key, or these 7 beats will not attach to anything. Existing episodes only carry HOOK/OP/ACT_1..5/ENDING."
